                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Snyder to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-01-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 20, 1904</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received
                        January 22, 1904, 9.45 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Snyder reports that the difficulty between the street railway company and
                    the National Government has been satisfactorily arranged to-day through this
                    legation. Requests that the Bogotá City Railway Company, 55 Liberty street, New
                    York city, be informed.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
